Appendix 1:  Support and Updates




	If you wish to purchase 4D-BBS, please send your request including
your name, mailing address, telephone number with a check or money order in
the amount of $49.95* (payable in US FUNDS only) to U.S.  address listed
below.  Make checks payable to CornerStone Software.  Washington state
residents MUST add 8% sales tax to the above price.  Overseas residents may
contact CornerStone Software - Sweden for purchasing information.

	Upon receiving your order, you will be mailed one 3.5" diskette
containing a full-working version of 4D-BBS and a registration form.  A
documentation manual will accompany the diskette in hard copy form as well
as in plain text for on the diskette.

	It is important that once you receive your copy of 4D-BBS, the
registration form be completed and returned to CornerStone Software without
delay.  This will give you access to updates of 4D-BBS, which are available
for downloading from the 4D-BBS support library on both 4D-BBS support
bulletin boards.

